{"code":"328380","name":"솔트웨어","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"IT서비스","sector_desc":"시스템 구축(SI)·운영·클라우드 서비스. 기업 IT 투자 규모와 그룹사 물량에 실적이 연동됩니다.","desc":"동사는 2003년 설립된 AI와 클라우드 전문기업으로, 2022년 코스닥 시장에 상장함. 공공기관, 대학, 금융, 제조, 스타트업을 포함한 광범위한 고객 기반으로 클라우드 매니지드 서비스(MSP)를 핵심 사업으로 진행하고 있음. AWS, Red Hat, SailPoint와 전략적 파트너십을 맺고 있으며, 국내 AWS MSP 사업자 중 코스닥 상장 유일 기업임.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":3435.0,"open":3390.0,"high":3470.0,"low":3300.0,"volume":6475,"amount":22241625.0,"ret_1d":-3.3755,"gap":-4.6414,"range_pct":4.9491,"ret_5":4.0909,"ret_20":-8.4,"ret_60":17.2355,"ret_120":-22.3729,"ret_250":-30.4656,"ma20":3613.5,"ma60":3664.9167,"ma120":3387.875,"ma200":3661.475,"close_vs_ma200":-6.1853,"close_vs_ma60":-6.2734,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":37.0681,"r2_60":0.0574,"slope_120":36.0856,"r2_120":0.0593,"slope_250":-29.4351,"r2_250":0.3322,"high52":5490.0,"low52":2285.0,"pos_52w":35.8814,"dd_52w":-37.4317,"mdd_1y":-52.1393,"atr14_pct":10.6571,"vol_ann_60":54.4867,"vol_avg20":10060.7,"vol_ratio20":0.6436,"vr5":0.1247,"vr20":0.1329,"amount_avg5":18379711.0,"amount_avg20":36091919.0,"amount_avg60":165544023.75,"obv_chg20":12.4927,"turnover_20":2.9363,"pv_eff_20":-2.8607,"rsi14":44.0063,"frgn_net_5":-6852.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.1,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.1,"frgn_net_20":-10797.0,"inst_net_20":1000.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.1576,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0146,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.143,"frgn_net_60":48080.0,"inst_net_60":96459.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.7016,"inst_net_60_pct":1.4076,"smart_net_60_pct":2.1093,"frgn_net_120":-61073.0,"inst_net_120":305122.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.8912,"inst_net_120_pct":4.4527,"smart_net_120_pct":3.5614,"foreign_ratio":1.29,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.51,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-8.0,"op_margin_q":-4.0201,"op_qoq":-700.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-900.0,"rev_yoy":38.1944,"op_trend_4q":-58.8235,"fin_period":"202606","roe":1.28,"debt_ratio":59.82,"per":81.79,"pbr":1.02,"div_yield":null,"foreign